{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.poster.avif?t=1748617540\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.webm?t=1748617540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687960/extras/991bb46d9f21507a8437e9ed93309fc9.mp4?t=1748617540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your piloting skills in this endless runner set in a dystopian corporate future! Fly your space ship through the dangerous, hazard-filled orbit of Cetos while collecting salvage. Oh, and please try not to feed the fish - your supervisor won't appreciate the policy violation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a skill based flight mechanic that allows you to precisely orient your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outpace a giant space fish determined to eat you for lunch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid asteroids, space mines, rogue missiles, and 50+ other hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate procedurally generated salvage runs assembled from over 100+ hand-crafted level segments across 4 unique regions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100+ lines of &quot;motivational&quot; dialog from your cat supervisor.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outperform other employees across online leaderboards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as